## Performance & Testing

### Performance Considerations
- Use `tokio::task::block_in_place` for sync operations in async context
- Implement proper async/await patterns throughout
- Cache expensive operations (screenshots, system queries)
- Use Arc for shared state when needed

### Testing Protocol
1. Test voice dictation modes independently
2. Verify computer use actions work correctly
3. Test agent delegation and response integration
4. Validate event flow and state synchronization
5. Check permissions and platform integration

### QA Commands
Available in [src-tauri/src/commands/mouse.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/commands/mouse.rs) for manual testing and validation.
